  "mut_desc_Afraid of the Dark": "Vision provided by all sources is extremely limited except when in view of your camera.",
  "mut_desc_Trick or Treat": "Civilians visit your Candy Bowl looking for treats, which are generated by spending minerals. If no treats are available, the civilians transform into random enemy units.",
  "mut_desc_Turkey Shoot": "Supply can only be generated by killing turkeys that wander throughout the map. Doing so may anger the turkeys that remain.",
  "mut_desc_Sharing Is Caring": "Supply is shared between you and your partner, and units from both armies contribute to your combined supply cap.",
  "mut_desc_Diffusion": "Damage dealt to enemies is split evenly across all nearby units, including your own.",
  "mut_desc_Black Death": "Some enemy units carry a plague that deals damage over time and spreads to other nearby units. The plague spreads to your units when the enemy unit is killed.",
  "mut_desc_Eminent Domain": "Enemies gain control of your structures after destroying them.",
  "mut_desc_Gift Exchange": "Gifts are periodically deployed around the map. If you don't claim them, Amon will!",
  "mut_desc_Naughty List": "Player units and structures take increased damage for each enemy they've killed.",
  "mut_desc_Extreme Caution": "Your units will not obey any command placed in areas they cannot see.",
  "mut_desc_Insubordination": "Your units don't follow orders exactly.",
  "mut_desc_Heroes from the Storm": "Attack waves will be joined by heroes of increasing power.",
  "mut_desc_Inspiration": "Enemy Heroic units increase the attack speed and armor of all enemies within a small range.",
  "mut_desc_Hardened Will": "Enemy Heroic units reduce all incoming damage to a maximum of 10 when any non-heroic enemy unit is near them.",
  "mut_desc_Fireworks": "Enemies launch a dazzling fireworks display upon death, dealing damage to your nearby units.",
  "mut_desc_Lucky Envelopes": "Festive envelopes containing resource pickups are dropped at random throughout the map.",
  "mut_desc_Sluggishness": "Your units accelerate and turn slowly.",
  "mut_desc_Double-Edged": "Your units also receive all the damage they deal, but they are healed over time.",
  "mut_desc_Fatal Attraction": "When enemy units and structures die, any of your nearby units are pulled to their location.",
  "mut_desc_Propagators": "Shapeless lifeforms creep toward your base, transforming all of the units and structures they touch into copies of themselves.",
  "mut_desc_Moment Of Silence": "When a Heroic enemy dies, all player units around it will reflect on their transgressions, leaving them unable to attack or use abilities.",
  "mut_desc_Kill Bots": "Offensive robots of a mysterious origin have been unleashed on the Koprulu sector, intent on destruction. Through cunning engineering, they are invincible until their pre-programmed kill counter has been filled. After that occurs, they will shut down. But can you survive for that long?",
  "mut_desc_Boom Bots": "Uncaring automatons carry a nuclear payload toward your base. One player must discern the disarming sequence and the other player must enter it.",
  "mut_desc_The Mist": "Mists roll over battlefield while unseen terrors lurk inside. Desperate warriors will fall and rise again.",
  "mut_desc_The Usual Suspects": "Enemy attacks will be led by dark reflections of Heroes in the service of Amon",
  "mut_desc_Supreme Commander": "Massive units gain 25% life and are bigger, the rest of units have 25% less life and are smaller. All units gain +2 weapon range.",
  "mut_desc_Shapeshifters": "Shapeshifters spawn with enemy attacks and in enemy bases. These creatures can transform into any unit of yours.",
  "mut_desc_Rip Field Generators": "Rip-field generators deployed on the battlefield continuously deal damage to player units within their area.",
  "mut_desc_Repulsive Field": "Repulsive field generators knock back player units that approach them.",
  "mut_desc_Old Times": "Classic units and gameplay elements return to the battlefield.",
  "mut_desc_Nuclear Mines": "High-yield nuclear mines are scattered across the battlefield.",
  "mut_desc_Necronomicon": "Dark rituals summon demonic monstrosities to the battlefield.",
  "mut_desc_Mothership": "An enemy Mothership patrols the map with devastating offensive capabilities.",
  "mut_desc_Matryoshka": "Destroying enemy units spawns successive waves of smaller enemy units.",
  "mut_desc_Level Playing Field": "Both player and enemy forces share identical advantages and restrictions.",
  "mut_desc_Infestation Station": "An infested station floats over the battlefield, continuously spawning zerg forces.",
  "mut_desc_I Collect, I Change": "Harvest biomass and scrap across the battlefield to trigger genetic evolutions.",
  "mut_desc_Great Wall": "Impenetrable fortifications and barrier walls block your advance.",
  "mut_desc_Endurance": "Enemy forces possess extraordinary health and endurance under heavy fire.",
  "mut_desc_Dark Mirror": "Dark mirrored replicas of your army are deployed against you.",
  "mut_desc_Bloodlust": "Enemy units enter a bloodthirsty frenzy in combat, greatly increasing attack and movement speed.",
  "mut_desc_BlizzCon Challenge": "Special high-difficulty celebration challenge mutator from BlizzCon.",
